ting A1; a wider consensus violation requires additional evidence.\", \"source_ids\": [\"src_append_handler\", \"src_log_append\", \"src_unstable_replace\", \"src_step\", \"src_raw_append\", \"src_raw_storage_tail\", \"src_unstable_view_contract\", \"src_storage_completion_contract\", \"src_log_term_view\", \"src_log_slice_view\", \"src_async_delivery\", \"src_unstable_accept\", \"src_unstable_stable\", \"src_applied\", \"src_async_config\", \"src_unstable_term_view\", \"src_log_commit\", \"src_replication\", \"src_election\", \"src_transfer_roles\", \"src_tracker\", \"src_majority\", \"src_quorum_joint\", \"src_cfg_activation\", \"src_startup\", \"src_snapshot_restore\", \"src_changer\", \"src_reset\", \"src_leader_proposal\", \"src_pending_reads\", \"src_read_tracker\", \"src_send\", \"src_raw_entry\", \"src_async_contract\", \"src_replication_retry\", \"src_progress_reject\", \"src_log_recover\", \"src_restore_config\", \"src_log_restore\", \"src_bootstrap\"], \"participants\": [\"Follower with ordered append worker\", \"Successive actual leaders\", \"Voting peers supporting elections\"], \"objects\": [\"Current accepted log entry\", \"In-progress replacement append\", \"Delayed local append-completion response\", \"Logical log term and entry queries\"], \"contexts\": [\"AsyncStorageWrites with reliable FIFO append requests and FIFO local completion delivery; responses to distinct remote recipients may progress separately after their writes\", \"Fixed voter set, network delay/loss and no process crash, no snapshot within the selected interval\", \"Same index and original entry term recur in a later leader context after an intervening conflicting stored version\"], \"event_paths\": [\"Actual elections and replication -> follower accepts replacement -> Ready emits replacement storage request\", \"Earlier append worker completion -> RawNode.Step(MsgStorageAppendResp) -> term validation -> unstable stabilization -> logical log lookup\"], \"activity_classes\": [\"A1\", \"A2\", \"A6\"], \"behavior_ids\": [\"B_ACCEPT_HISTORY\", \"B_STORAGE_FRONTIER\", \"B_LOG_VIEW\"], \"fact_ids\": [\"F_ACCEPTED_HISTORY\"], \"supporting_behavior_ids\": {\"B_ELECT\": \"Actual candidate/vote paths produce successive leader contexts instead of direct role assignment.\", \"B_RESET\": \"Term transition changes the validation context for pending storage replies.\", \"B_ACK_QUEUE\": \"Remote replication responses are delayed until their corresponding storage writes complete.\", \"B_REPLICATION_SEND\": \"Actual append rejection/retry produces the latest replacement; no handcrafted protocol message is needed.\", \"B_RECONSTRUCT\": \"Caller-supplied initial snapshot and HardState construct a common committed prefix.\"}, \"obligation_relation_kind\": \"preservation\", \"counterevidence\": [\"Step ignores stale-term entry stabilization even if entry identity matches.\", \"unstable.stableTo independently checks entry term/index.\", \"Current-term completion after replacement persistence can safely retire the overlay.\", \"Exploration 9e5d14f4513e4988a856d198246a176f observed preservation, but it has no fixed property comparison and is not formal Evidence.\"], \"unknowns\": [], \"priority\": 2, \"trigger_rationale\": \"The completed actual-producer exploration reached conflicting Storage and current unstable history at the same index, then consumed an old completion. Fix an independent current accepted-entry oracle and fresh execution to assess the local contract without inferring a broader consensus consequence.\"}, \"status\": \"escalated\", \"parent_candidate_id\": null, \"fork_reason\": \"\", \"stop_reason\": \"Register current accepted-history preservation and fix a local implementation contract before a fresh direct check.\", \"resume_conditions\": [], \"obligation_id\": \"C_ACCEPTED_LOG_VIEW\", \"result_claim_ids\": [], \"open_issue_ids\": [], \"current_applicability\": \"within_recorded_scope\", \"executions\": [], \"record\": {\"path\": \"state.json\",